{
    "title": "Eldrum: Untold, Text-Based RPG",
    "description": "\u2694\ufe0f Get involved in an interactive text-based RPG adventure story with engaging NPC interactions and medieval fantasy fighting duels - Choose your own adventure! Choices that you make really matter in our tabletop style CYOA game - Explore and develop your role-playing story!\r\n\r\nTry before you buy! Untold is free to try up to a certain point in the story where you\u2019ll be offered to purchase the full game in order to continue.\r\n\r\nUntold is an immersive text-based RPG adventure story, combining old-school CYOA (Choose Your Own Adventure) features with modern twists. You are offered a variety of choices to build an adventure story exactly how you want, to move it in the way you prefer.\r\n\r\n<b>Plot</b>\r\n\r\nYou wake up on a beach - shipwrecked, confused, and traumatized. Follow the footprints and you will find a fellow survivor in the wilderness. She is a nomad, who seems to have endured the same traumatic experiences. Together, you embark on a quest for answers and retribution. As you venture through the world to discover the truth in this interactive fiction story, you\u2019ll gather equipment and forge your character.\r\n\r\nThe lands of Tem Khiris are drenched in blood. You must figure out a way to survive in this world of warring states and rival tribes. Proceed with caution, for death lurks around every corner. Poor decisions will soon send you on a one-way trip to the Underworld.\r\n\r\nChoose your own adventure in this mobile text-based dark fantasy RPG!\r\n\r\n<b>Main features of this text-based RPG (CYOA):</b>\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0f <b>Tabletop Role-Playing Game</b> - Experience the tabletop style RPG through the mysterious challenges that you will face.\r\n\u2714\ufe0f <b>NPC Interactions</b> - Unique and engaging non-playing character iterations, which are controlled by artificial intelligence, are indispensable parts of this fantasy adventure story.\r\n\u2714\ufe0f <b>Adventure Path</b> - Many secrets are waiting for you to discover them. Every choice makes your unique path!\r\n\u2714\ufe0f <b>Upgrades</b> - Equip and build your character to make it more stronger and powerful.\r\n\u2714\ufe0f <b>Endless Fun</b> - There is over 8 hours of playtime (estimated, single play-through), which means a lot of moments to enjoy in this interactive medieval fighting fantasy story!\r\n\u2714\ufe0f <b>Replayability</b> - Our role-playing game is enabling you to play with different styles opening up different locations, NPCs, and gear. Choose your own adventure!\r\n\u2714\ufe0f <b>Text-Based RPG</b> - Adventure RPG story with unique gameplay based on the text and engaging NPC interactions. Enjoy the beauty of multiple endings!\r\n\u2714\ufe0f <b>Phone & Tablet Support</b> - It is supported for both phones and tablets, so you can enjoy playing it from any of your mobile devices!\r\n\u2714\ufe0f <b>TalkBack Support</b> - Accessible to blind and low-vision player using screenreaders\r\n\r\nChoose wisely, because your choices matter!\r\n\r\n<b>In the news</b>\r\n\r\n\u201cA full-on RPG, complete with character progression, inventory management, and NPC interactions ... The character development and combat systems find that sweet spot between being too simplistic to matter and becoming a bloated distraction.\u201d \u2013 Gamespace.com\r\n\r\n\u201cUntold RPG is a really solid and convenient package. It delivers feelings of grand adventure while allowing you to experiment and explore, and it does this pretty much all through the text. It may not satisfy folks looking for a flashier, more action-packed experience, but Untold's restraint is exactly what makes it so impressive and refreshing.\u201d \u2013 148apps.com\r\n\r\nDownload this mysterious CYOA text-based RPG and get engaged in challenging situations that are created by the choices that you make. Enjoy everything that this interactive tabletop role-playing game is offering to you. Choose your own fantasy adventure story! Just start playing and make a choice!\r\n\r\n<b>Follow us:</b>\r\n\r\nFacebook: www.facebook.com/EldrumRPG\r\nTwitter: www.twitter.com/EldrumRPG\r\nYouTube: www.youtube.com/@eldrum\r\nDiscord: discord.eldrum.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2694\ufe0f Get involved in an interactive text-based RPG adventure story with engaging NPC interactions and medieval fantasy fighting duels - Choose your own adventure! Choices that you make really matter in our tabletop style CYOA game - Explore and develop your role-playing story!<br><br>Try before you buy! Untold is free to try up to a certain point in the story where you\u2019ll be offered to purchase the full game in order to continue.<br><br>Untold is an immersive text-based RPG adventure story, combining old-school CYOA (Choose Your Own Adventure) features with modern twists. You are offered a variety of choices to build an adventure story exactly how you want, to move it in the way you prefer.<br><br><b>Plot</b><br><br>You wake up on a beach - shipwrecked, confused, and traumatized. Follow the footprints and you will find a fellow survivor in the wilderness. She is a nomad, who seems to have endured the same traumatic experiences. Together, you embark on a quest for answers and retribution. As you venture through the world to discover the truth in this interactive fiction story, you\u2019ll gather equipment and forge your character.<br><br>The lands of Tem Khiris are drenched in blood. You must figure out a way to survive in this world of warring states and rival tribes. Proceed with caution, for death lurks around every corner. Poor decisions will soon send you on a one-way trip to the Underworld.<br><br>Choose your own adventure in this mobile text-based dark fantasy RPG!<br><br><b>Main features of this text-based RPG (CYOA):</b><br><br>\u2714\ufe0f <b>Tabletop Role-Playing Game</b> - Experience the tabletop style RPG through the mysterious challenges that you will face.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <b>NPC Interactions</b> - Unique and engaging non-playing character iterations, which are controlled by artificial intelligence, are indispensable parts of this fantasy adventure story.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <b>Adventure Path</b> - Many secrets are waiting for you to discover them. Every choice makes your unique path!<br>\u2714\ufe0f <b>Upgrades</b> - Equip and build your character to make it more stronger and powerful.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <b>Endless Fun</b> - There is over 8 hours of playtime (estimated, single play-through), which means a lot of moments to enjoy in this interactive medieval fighting fantasy story!<br>\u2714\ufe0f <b>Replayability</b> - Our role-playing game is enabling you to play with different styles opening up different locations, NPCs, and gear. Choose your own adventure!<br>\u2714\ufe0f <b>Text-Based RPG</b> - Adventure RPG story with unique gameplay based on the text and engaging NPC interactions. Enjoy the beauty of multiple endings!<br>\u2714\ufe0f <b>Phone &amp; Tablet Support</b> - It is supported for both phones and tablets, so you can enjoy playing it from any of your mobile devices!<br>\u2714\ufe0f <b>TalkBack Support</b> - Accessible to blind and low-vision player using screenreaders<br><br>Choose wisely, because your choices matter!<br><br><b>In the news</b><br><br>\u201cA full-on RPG, complete with character progression, inventory management, and NPC interactions ... The character development and combat systems find that sweet spot between being too simplistic to matter and becoming a bloated distraction.\u201d \u2013 Gamespace.com<br><br>\u201cUntold RPG is a really solid and convenient package. It delivers feelings of grand adventure while allowing you to experiment and explore, and it does this pretty much all through the text. It may not satisfy folks looking for a flashier, more action-packed experience, but Untold&#39;s restraint is exactly what makes it so impressive and refreshing.\u201d \u2013 148apps.com<br><br>Download this mysterious CYOA text-based RPG and get engaged in challenging situations that are created by the choices that you make. Enjoy everything that this interactive tabletop role-playing game is offering to you. Choose your own fantasy adventure story! Just start playing and make a choice!<br><br><b>Follow us:</b><br><br>Facebook: www.facebook.com/EldrumRPG<br>Twitter: www.twitter.com/EldrumRPG<br>YouTube: www.youtube.com/@eldrum<br>Discord: discord.eldrum.com",
